# 06. The Vertical Slice Strategy

The most important implementation strategy in AEGIS is:

> **Build vertically before building horizontally.**

Horizontal development:

```text
Build all UI
Build all API
Build all database
Build all AI
```

creates long periods where nothing truly works together.

Vertical development:

```text
One real workflow
 ↓
UI
 ↓
State
 ↓
Data
 ↓
API
 ↓
Audit
 ↓
Telemetry
 ↓
Tests
```

creates working evidence early.

